svelte:667](ov/src/lib/svelte/filter/Editor_Filters.svelte#L667) (ov-filter):

```css
.information-rows {
    margin-top     : var(--gap);
    gap            : var(--gap-tiny);
    flex-direction : column;
    display        : flex;
}
```

This puts `--gap` above the content and touches nothing else. I did not target `.label-rows`, since search, backlinks and kinds share it. Say go and I make it.

